WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:10.010
What the...?

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:13.596
I see. You're the assassin, aren't you?

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:15.890
Dodged!

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:17.308
You asshole!

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.982
So, your target must be Tokita!

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.822
He used Tokita's leg to jump up on him?

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.950
This jerk is...

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:40.331
You have some nerve.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.208
It's Ohma's turn to attack.

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.549
Ground grappling techniques?

00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:53.344
It's not a bad idea.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:58.058
But unfortunately, you're too light.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.187
He stopped at the last moment!

00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:06.191
I'd have landed that blow
if I hadn't noticed. You brat.

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:11.404
A girl?

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:15.742
You can't mask your gender.
I could tell by your scent.

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:19.037
What the hell do you want?

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.127
I want to have a baby with you.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:27.545
What?

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.800
I knew you were strong
as soon as I saw you.

00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:36.054
I'm Karura. Be my husband.

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:38.056
That's, um...

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:41.309
-A marriage proposal?
-Why is she asking him now?

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:43.144
My grandpa told me

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:46.481
that it's the responsibility of the head
of the family to have strong offspring.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:51.277
-Excuse me, miss. Could you explain--
-Let's make babies together!

00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:52.570
Hello, are you ignoring me?

00:01:52.821 --> 00:01:55.573
They were all very confused

00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:58.326
by her sudden and baffling
marriage proposal.

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:02.789
But the one who felt most confused was...

00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:04.707
this man.

00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:07.001
Babies? Husband?

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:09.796
Me? With this girl?

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.507
What the hell is she talking about?

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:16.302
Wow, even Ohma is shocked,
and he's usually so cool!

00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:20.598
Come on, let's make some babies together!
Children that are yours and mine!

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:23.351
Our children will undoubtedly
become the greatest ever warriors!

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:25.687
Let's get married right now!

